1366
01:38:09.223 --> 01:38:10.224
The true one.

1367
01:38:10.307 --> 01:38:11.391
[chuckles]

1368
01:38:11.850 --> 01:38:14.728
The one that is
most true to you.

1369
01:38:15.854 --> 01:38:18.023
